  "teachEndSec": 91.96,
  "style": "teach_then_qa",
  "segments": [
    {
      "idx": 0,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "hook",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": "why",
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "exam_context.student_facing_hook",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "先别急着背安全管理。起重吊装题真正问的是:这一下能不能正式吊。考场最容易丢的是最后一句:先试吊,再检查,确认安全后继续。",
      "startSec": 0,
      "durSec": 11.688,
      "requestId": "8bf42d87-4e32-9b8e-ae29-fc5c4a0400b5",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 1,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "trap",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": "wrong_idea",
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "teaching_spine.wrong_idea",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "很多人会想,人员持证,设备完好,那就可以直接吊。这个想法很危险,因为它把起重吊装当成设备能力题,漏掉了正式起吊前的放行判断。",
      "startSec": 12.088,
      "durSec": 11.976,
      "requestId": "a3ad1cea-5161-9a83-ab0c-c71e42763f3b",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 2,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "personnel",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": "personnel",
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "decision.judgment_points[personnel].criterion",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "第一道门看人。起重司机、信号工、司索工这类关键人员,必须持证到位。缺人缺证,就不要往下走。",
      "startSec": 24.464,
      "durSec": 8.736,
      "requestId": "cb305144-b028-9e06-919c-49289574c9f1",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 3,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "device",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": "device",
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "decision.judgment_points[device_environment].criterion",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "第二道门看装置和环境。安全装置要完整可靠;恶劣天气要停吊;雨雪后复工,还要清理现场,做好防滑和防漏电。",
      "startSec": 33.6,
      "durSec": 9.792,
      "requestId": "c2a0011e-4270-9d00-9a8f-f4caab8e9306",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 4,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "trial",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": "trial_lift",
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "decision.judgment_points[trial_lift].criterion",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "第三道门是本题的刀口。起吊荷载达到额定起重量百分之九十以上,先把重物离地约十五厘米试吊,检查平稳性、设备和绑扎,确认安全后才能继续。",
      "startSec": 43.792,
      "durSec": 12.696,
      "requestId": "b2a8fe3e-972e-9ffc-858a-e12e3a6f7bbd",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 5,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "stop",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": "emergency",
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "decision.judgment_points[emergency_guard].criterion",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "第四道门看异常处置。突然停电或异常时,控制器归零,断开电源,把重物安全降到地面,不能让重物长时间悬空。",
      "startSec": 56.888,
      "durSec": 10.68,
      "requestId": "ea7d528f-6bcb-944e-865a-65c434af0f84",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 6,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "score",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": "score_sentence",
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "teaching_spine.exam_phrase",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "落到答题纸上,不要只写不能吊。要写完整:百分之九十以上,离地约十五厘米试吊,检查平稳性、设备和绑扎,确认安全后方可继续。",
      "startSec": 67.968,
      "durSec": 12.144,
      "requestId": "99e7ba43-2080-9487-97c8-755e5b79785f",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 7,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "bridge",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": "memory_hook",
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "memory_hook",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "记住四道门:人证、装置环境、试吊、停吊应急。接下来换成缺信号工、雨雪后复工、突然停电,你仍然按这四道门判。",
      "startSec": 80.512,
      "durSec": 11.448,
      "requestId": "b34cd4e3-542a-9216-897a-48d3645cc2a8",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 8,
      "kind": "q",
      "state": "conclude",
      "qaIndex": 0,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "S",
      "voice": "Ethan",
      "anchor": null,
      "claim": false,
      "text": "如果人员和设备都没问题,是不是就差不多可以吊了?",
      "startSec": 92.36,
      "durSec": 3.52,
      "requestId": "37080aea-d23c-96eb-9880-2829cba02cf5",
      "provider": "aliyun_qwen_tts",
      "model": "qwen3-tts-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 9,
      "kind": "a",
      "state": "conclude",
      "qaIndex": 0,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "decision.judgment_points[trial_lift].verdict_reason",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "还不行。本题是百分之九十五额定起重量,已经过了百分之九十控制线。没有先试吊检查,就不能直接正式起吊。",
      "startSec": 96.28,
      "durSec": 9.312,
      "requestId": "1850f352-a51b-91a5-b9eb-1fe3e32edf35",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 10,
      "kind": "q",
      "state": "conclude",
      "qaIndex": 1,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "S",
      "voice": "Ethan",
      "anchor": null,
      "claim": false,
      "text": "雨雪后是不是只要雪停了,就能恢复吊装?",
      "startSec": 105.992,
      "durSec": 3.28,
      "requestId": "375310ba-46ef-98a2-9d9e-f54756fedafa",
      "provider": "aliyun_qwen_tts",
      "model": "qwen3-tts-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 11,
      "kind": "a",
      "state": "conclude",
      "qaIndex": 1,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "process_overlay.steps[environment].action",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "不能只看雪停。要清理冰雪,采取防滑、防漏电措施,再确认设备状态可靠。天气后复工本身就是一道放行门。",
      "startSec": 109.672,
      "durSec": 10.128,
      "requestId": "9c8b4f79-99d5-99ae-acaa-ed88ebb91bd2",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 12,
      "kind": "q",
      "state": "conclude",
      "qaIndex": 2,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "S",
      "voice": "Ethan",
      "anchor": null,
      "claim": false,
      "text": "停电的时候,重物已经吊起来了,能不能先悬着等一会儿?",
      "startSec": 120.2,
      "durSec": 3.84,
      "requestId": "1412417e-ef30-9506-aed1-38801b61adcf",
      "provider": "aliyun_qwen_tts",
      "model": "qwen3-tts-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 13,
      "kind": "a",
      "state": "conclude",
      "qaIndex": 2,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "decision.judgment_points[emergency_guard].criterion",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "不能。异常时要控制器归零,断开电源,把重物安全降到地面。长时间悬空就是这类题的典型扣分点。",
      "startSec": 124.44,
      "durSec": 9.36,
      "requestId": "f2a6025a-5133-91ce-9f5d-540f409334ca",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 14,
      "kind": "a",
      "state": "closing",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "teaching_spine.warm_correction",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "收个尾:起重吊装别只写设备没问题。先过四道门,尤其把高负荷试吊检查写完整。现在开始闯关,看你能不能把这句话迁移到新题里。",
      "startSec": 134.2,
      "durSec": 12.408,
      "requestId": "16d0595f-cbcf-92f1-974f-9018b0907b77",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    }
  ]
}